Package: ggtubemap
Title: Pangenome Tube Maps in 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Colin", "Diesh", email = "colin.diesh@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Wolfgang", "Beyer", role = "cph",
           comment = "sequenceTubeMap layout, bundled in inst/js")
  )
Description: Draws pangenome graphs as tube maps, the view of
    'sequenceTubeMap', with 'ggplot2'. The layout runs from the
    '@jbrowse/tubemap-core' JavaScript library in an embedded 'QuickJS'
    engine, and every tube, node and base comes back as polygons and text
    that 'ggplot2' layers draw, so tube maps take scales, themes and vector
    output like any other plot.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/GMOD/ggtubemap
